<Prose title="Changelog · GitHub Reskin" heading="Changelog" description="What changed in each GitHub Reskin release." path="changelog/">
  <h2>2.0.0</h2>
  <p>Thirteen anime-inspired themes, twelve Classics, Full and Calm, flavor extras with one switch to turn them off, and a theme builder with an AI prompt and import, in the extension and the userscript. The <a href={`${SUPPORT.source}/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md`}>changelog in the source repository</a> lists every change.</p>
  <h2>1.1.0</h2>
  <p>Color themes with an editor, the contribution graph in your colors, a userscript and the contribution-graph GitHub Action.</p>
</Prose>
